{
    "title": "Viator Tours & Attractions",
    "description": "Thanks to industry-leading flexibility and last-minute availability, it's never too late to make any day extraordinary. And with our mobile app putting world-class travel experiences in the palm of your hand, your dream trip is just a few taps away. Whether you need inspiration for things to do on your trip or want to access your tickets on the go, the app has you covered. Here\u2019s how: \r\n\r\nBook and manage your trip on the go:\r\n\u2022 Browse our amazing selection of tours and activities before and during your trip\r\n\u2022 Easily access tickets offline\r\n\u2022 Modify, edit, or cancel your bookings from wherever you are\r\n\u2022 Get same-day notifications about your activity with directions to your departure and pickup points\r\n\u2022 Free cancellation up to 24 hours in advance\r\n\r\nEasy trip planning:\r\n\u2022 Read millions of reviews from Tripadvisor and our Viator travel communities\r\n\u2022 Contact tour guides directly for easy communication\r\n\u2022 Create wishlists of all tours and activities you want to book\r\n\r\nFlexible payment options:\r\n\u2022 Reserve now and pay later\r\n\u2022 Pay in installments with Klarna\r\n\u2022 Book with Credit Card, PayPal, or Google Pay\r\n\r\nExclusive app-only promos:\r\n\u2022 Take advantage of in-app messaging offering the latest promos and special offers \r\n\r\nViator Rewards\r\nWith Viator Rewards, you\u2019ll earn rewards on every eligible purchase.  The best part? You can use them to save actual money on future bookings. Do more with Viator. Earn. Redeem. Repeat. Simple as that. \r\n\r\nNo matter what type of traveler you are, Viator will help you make memories that will last a lifetime.\r\n\r\nBut don\u2019t just take it from us. Here\u2019s what our travel community says about the Viator app:\r\n\r\n\u201cSo easy and efficient. Even ol\u2019 guys like me can easily maneuver using the Viator app! Awesome!\u201d\r\n\r\n\u201cGreat app. Easy to navigate, lots of options, and great info.\u201d\r\n\r\nRated 4.3/5 on Trustpilot with over 57,000 verified reviews.\r\n\r\nP.S. Having technical issues with the app? Please email mobileappsupport@viator.com\r\n\r\nJoin the Viator App Feedback Team\r\nShare your thoughts about the Viator App to make it better for our travel community.\r\nhttps://www.userinterviews.com/opt-in/bTQXz4p6A6krCkVi475HFRm7",
